9e8e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/room/1689526/e9874a25-1483-40fd-a3e6-ab4ef5659e8e.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Bitte beachten Sie, dass HousingAnywhere eine Online-Buchungsplattform ist. Daher ist es nicht möglich, Kontaktdaten auszutauschen und Besichtigungen anzubieten. Wenn Sie diese Unterkunft reservieren möchten, senden Sie mir eine Buchungsanfrage oder eine Nachricht!\n\nPlease note that HousingAnywhere is an online booking platform. Therefore it is not possible to change contact data or do viewings prior to booking. If you want to reserve this place, send me a booking request or a message!\n\n\nThis beautiful apartment in Hofheim am Taunus (20 minutes to Frankfurt Airport) is newly renovated and equipped with all objects of daily use. The bathroom is also new and has underfloor heating, a washing machine and even a dryer. \nIn the bedroom there is a large 1.80m bed, which is designed for up to 2 people. \nThe living room is harmoniously furnished and instantly makes you feel at home. Furthermore, the kitchen has everything you need, from cups, pots, plates to a microwave. \nThanks to floor-to-ceiling windows on both sides of the apartment, it is pleasantly bright and, with its high ceilings (up to ~ 3.50m), appears very airy.\nSo, all you need to bring is your suitcase to set yourself up in this beautiful environment. \n\nThe apartment is located between Wiesbaden and Frankfurt and is only  7 minutes away from the highways A3 & A66. Frankfurt Airport (FRA) is only 20 minutes away by car and therefore perfect for business travellers.\n\nEnclosed you will find a small list of the equipment:\n\n- Completely new bathroom, including underfloor heating\n- New, light laminate flooring in the whole apartment\n- All walls freshly painted white\n- New electrical appliances: was